                                "text": "c. 1699-1736, Jonathan Swift, Of the Education of Ladies\nThat in the mean time, her household affairs, and the care of her children, will be wholly laid aside; her toilet will be crowded with all the under-wits, where the conversation will pass in criticising on the last play or poem that comes out […]"
